Canonical agent policy lives in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root (Cursor also reads it natively) — treat it as binding.

- NEVER push `main`. Named branches (`nickstire/<task>` · `statenour/<task>` · `docs/<task>` · `chore/<task>`) + PR only.
- Stage only your files by explicit path — never `git add -A`, never `--no-verify`, never force-push shared history.
- Read the nearest `apps/<app>/AGENTS.md` before editing inside an app (routing map: root `AGENTS.md` → "Context routing").
- Windows shell is PowerShell: chain with `;`, never `&&`.
- Concurrent agent sessions share this repo — scope changes to your assigned task only.

Full detail: `AGENTS.md` → "Agent adapters". Parity guarded by `pnpm agent:parity`.
